WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:02.406
Usar o Copiloto na conversa

2
00:00:02.407 --> 00:00:05.540
Clique na aba Todos

3
00:00:05.540 --> 00:00:11.735
Abra sua conversa

4
00:00:11.735 --> 00:00:13.726
No painel Contatos, bloco Copiloto

5
00:00:13.726 --> 00:00:15.533
Ou peça um rascunho de resposta

6
00:00:15.533 --> 00:00:17.878
Clique no botão de estrelinhas

7
00:00:17.878 --> 00:00:19.875
Abre o painel Copiloto Autonom.ia

8
00:00:19.875 --> 00:00:22.998
Escolha o agente no seletor

9
00:00:22.998 --> 00:00:26.176
Troque de agente, se houver mais de um

10
00:00:26.176 --> 00:00:29.044
Digite sua pergunta

11
00:00:29.044 --> 00:00:31.453
Pronto
